<title>FRANCE: Details of EU grain export/import balance.</title>
<headline>Details of EU grain export/import balance.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are details of EU grain export/import commitments as of October 1 in the July-to-June 1996/97 campaign, supplied by member country officials.</p>
<p>On October 3, the EU additionally granted exports of 330,025 tonnes of soft wheat, 235,300 tonnes of barley and 80,700 tonnes of rye.</p>
<p>Figures ('000 tonnes) are based on officially communicated certificates and are subject to revision.</p>
<p>			 ---------1996/97-------  ------1995/96-----</p>
<p>			     1Jul96 to 1Oct96	1Jul95 to 1Oct95</p>
<p>			 EXPORTS  PCT(1) IMPORTS  EXPORTS    IMPORTS</p>
<p>  Soft wheat(grain)  1,135	39     163    2,885	  675</p>
<p>  Flour (2)	    1,297	84	 4    1,546	    4</p>
<p>Food aid</p>
<p>    - grain		224     127	 0	176	    0</p>
<p>    - flour (2)	   11	19	 0	 58	    0</p>
