<p>    - grain		  0		   -	120	    -</p>
<p>    - flour (2)	    2		   0	 22	    0</p>
<p> TOTAL SOFT WHEAT    2,669	56     167    4,807	  679</p>
<p>  Durum (grain)	   16		 107	  0	  437</p>
<p>  Semolina (3)	    54		   0	 23	    0</p>
